# BuildKit per-Dockerfile ignore (build context = repo root).
*
!bridge
!chaos
**/node_modules
bridge/dist
**/.git
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log
**/npm-debug.log*
**/yarn-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log*
**/pnpm-debug.log*
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/coverage
**/.turbo
**/node-compile-cache
**/.secrets
**/*.pem
**/*.key
bridge/build
bridge/out
chaos/out
chaos/.cache
